OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of Dolly Parton's book
OL,4,Ascheme praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe impact of Dolly Parton's children's
OL,7,Fliterary scheme has been praised by a
OL,8,Fformer MP who helped bring the scheme
OL,9,Fto his constituency.
OL,11,FTributes have been poured in for the
OL,12,Fcountry singer who died aged 80. Her
OL,13,FImagination Library has had a presence
OL,14,Facross the South since it was launched
OL,15,Fin the UK in 2007.
OL,17,FMartin Salter, who was the MP for
OL,18,FReading West from 1997 until 2010, said
OL,19,Fhe believed his constituency was the
OL,20,Fsecond place in the country to receive
OL,21,Fbooks.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
